{
  "format_version": 1,
  "scope": "Synthetic predicate regression over native pySigma condition AST, with explicit logsource context. Not SIEM replay, telemetry normalization validation or production efficacy. Numeric fields are typed numbers; missing fields never satisfy positive equality. Candidate matches can be legitimate activity. All strings are inert fixtures.",
